[Dm]Jashn-e-Ishqa…Jashn-e-[Bb]-Ishqa

[Dm]Jashn-e-Ishqa…[C]Jashn-e-Ishqa

[Dm]Daur-e-ishqa [C]ek jashan hai

[Dm]Lekin apna [C]alag tashan hai

[Dm]Khoon mein sulgi [C]ek agan hai

[Bb]Beh ke dikhla [C]yega yeh [Dm]tevar

[Dm]Chaahat ke dar pe

[Bb]Dil ka dharna [C]hai

[Dm]Naa mar ke jeena

[Bb]Jee ke marna [C]hai

[Dm]Toofan ke [C]humdum

[Dm]Angaare hain [C]hum

[F]Dhadkan mein [Am]thoda sa

[Am]Baarood hai khwaahish ka [Dm]

[Dm]Jashn-e-Ishqa…Jashn-e-Ishqa

[Bb]Jashn-e-Ishqa…Jashn-e-Ishqa [x4]

[Dm]Jashn e Ishqa…Jashn e [Bb]Ishqa

[Dm]Jashn e Ishqa...[C]Jashn e Ishqa

[C]Loha jug, hum [Dm]aari

[C]Sab pe hain hum [Dm]bhaari

Aadha jag se [C]yaarana hai

Aadhi [Dm]Rab se yaari

[Dm]Chalta hai [C]sikka

[Dm]Hukamon ka [C]ikka

[F]Banta apna har [Am]din

Hi shola sa ishqa [Dm]

[Dm]Jashn-e-Ishqa…Jashn-e-Ishqa

[Bb]Jashn-e-Ishqa…Jashn-e-Ishqa [x4]

[Dm]Jashn e Ishqa…Jashn e [Bb]Ishqa

